## ✅ Things Done Well

- Prisma singleton pattern in `db.ts` correctly prevents connection exhaustion during dev hot-reload
- Proper fallback chains for DB URL resolution (`IPRINTR_URL` → `IPRINTR_PRISMA_URL` → `POSTGRES_URL`)
- `maxDuration` set on serverless routes — good for image generation
- Clean CSS design system with CSS custom properties
- Responsive grid layout with media queries
- Good UX patterns (loading states, error display, keyboard shortcut for Enter)

